    "28959b57-8b54-48fd-8951-7862b83877da": {
      "type": "copy-image",
      "settings": {
        "style": "bg-white",
        "layout": "copy",
        "vertical_align": "align-items-center",
        "heading": "Revolutionary ‘Nano Adsorption’ Filter Technology",
        "content": "<p>Traditional filters simply trap unwanted pollutants, allowing them to accumulate and multiply, which turns them into a breeding ground for contaminants within just two weeks - instantly polluting any water that passes through. To solve this crucial problem, we’ve developed revolutionary Nano Adsorption technology.<br/><br/><strong>How does it work?</strong></p><p>First, we use granular activated carbon derived from natural coconut husks to remove chemicals, toxins, and heavy metals such as zinc and lead. Then, we impregnate every filter with carbon adsorbents to prevent contaminant growth inside the filter itself. This filtration process mimics nature and keeps oxygen and mineral content unchanged, giving the water a spring-like freshness and a wholesome taste that’s second to none.</p>",
        "video_id": "",
        "large_image": "img_standard",
        "second_content": "",
        "buttonlink": "",
        "buttontext": "",
        "afterbutton": "",
        "custom_id": "",
        "custom_class": "",
        "bg_image_style": "contain",
        "section_randoimg_position": "top"
      }
    },
